      "sourceTextSha256": "e5b6e61bb6657add609c575683238b7f2a790dbff9e0f0b50a5794c01952d887",
      "text": "Day 2 · After breakfast, an early departure from Cuiabá for Porto Jofre, the gateway to the Northern Pantanal, along a scenic road that shows the transition from savanna to wetlands. In the afternoon, your first boat safari from the lodge, gliding along the rivers to spot herons, caimans and a wide variety of birdlife, in one of the richest wildlife areas of South America. Overnight at the Santa Rosa Lodge, with lunch and dinner.",
